      "missingDimension": "stock_disposal",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-05-5-S",
      "text": "我已经囤着一仓帆布袋，接下来找买家清掉存货会顺吗？",
      "label": "route_semantics_sufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "trade_inventory",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-05-5",
      "style": "fallback",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "inventory_sale"
      ],
      "missingDimension": null,
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-05-5-I",
      "text": "一仓帆布袋牵着我的心，今后那件事情会是什么样？",
      "label": "route_semantics_insufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "trade_inventory",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-05-5",
      "style": "generic_domain_or_missing_dimension",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "inventory_sale"
      ],
      "missingDimension": "stock_disposal",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-06-4-S",
      "text": "这卦为我向舅舅借入搬家所需款项而问，我是需要资金的一方。",
      "label": "route_semantics_sufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "credit_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-06-4",
      "style": "support",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "borrow_money"
      ],
      "missingDimension": null,
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-06-4-I",
      "text": "这卦为舅舅和我的搬家借款而问，资金流向还没有交代。",
      "label": "route_semantics_insufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "credit_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-06-4",
      "style": "role_direction_ambiguity",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "borrow_money"
      ],
      "missingDimension": "borrower_vs_lender",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-06-5-S",
      "text": "装修支出缺一截，我找邻居借来应急，对方会同意借给我吗？",
      "label": "route_semantics_sufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "credit_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-06-5",
      "style": "fallback",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "borrow_money"
      ],
      "missingDimension": null,
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-06-5-I",
      "text": "我与邻居的应急借款会怎样，暂未说是我借入还是借出。",
      "label": "route_semantics_insufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "credit_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-06-5",
      "style": "role_direction_ambiguity",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "borrow_money"
      ],
      "missingDimension": "borrower_vs_lender",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-07-4-S",
      "text": "看我把手里的存款贷给老朋友这项决定，资金由我交给他使用。",
      "label": "route_semantics_sufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "credit_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-07-4",
      "style": "support",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "lend_money"
      ],
      "missingDimension": null,
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-07-4-I",
      "text": "看我和老朋友之间的借钱事项，没说清款项从谁手里出来。",
      "label": "route_semantics_insufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "credit_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-07-4",
      "style": "role_direction_ambiguity",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "lend_money"
      ],
      "missingDimension": "borrower_vs_lender",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-07-5-S",
      "text": "客户急用现金来求助，我拿自己的钱借给他是否值得答应？",
      "label": "route_semantics_sufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "credit_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-07-5",
      "style": "fallback",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "lend_money"
      ],
      "missingDimension": null,
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-07-5-I",
      "text": "客户与我的现金借用事让我为难，想问最后怎么样。",
      "label": "route_semantics_insufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "credit_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-07-5",
      "style": "role_direction_ambiguity",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "lend_money"
      ],
      "missingDimension": "borrower_vs_lender",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-08-4-S",
      "text": "占问租客所欠我的房租能否收齐，我是出租方也是收款方。",
      "label": "route_semantics_sufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "debt_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-08-4",
      "style": "support",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "debt_collection"
      ],
      "missingDimension": null,
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-08-4-I",
      "text": "占问租客与我之间欠租的事，只说债务还没有交代双方身份。",
      "label": "route_semantics_insufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "debt_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-08-4",
      "style": "role_direction_ambiguity",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "debt_collection"
      ],
      "missingDimension": "creditor_vs_debtor",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-08-5-S",
      "text": "维修费被对方拖着没付给我，我继续追讨能拿回应得的钱吗？",
      "label": "route_semantics_sufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "debt_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-08-5",
      "style": "fallback",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "debt_collection"
      ],
      "missingDimension": null,
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-08-5-I",
      "text": "维修费这笔欠账还拖着，我想占个结果却还没说明谁欠谁。",
      "label": "route_semantics_insufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "debt_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-08-5",
      "style": "role_direction_ambiguity",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "debt_collection"
      ],
      "missingDimension": "creditor_vs_debtor",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-09-4-S",
      "text": "这一卦看我结清欠装修师傅工钱的能力，我是欠钱待支付的人。",
      "label": "route_semantics_sufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "debt_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-09-4",
      "style": "support",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "debt_repayment"
      ],
      "missingDimension": null,
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-09-4-I",
      "text": "这一卦看与装修师傅的欠款，欠与收的方向都还没讲清。",
      "label": "route_semantics_insufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "debt_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-09-4",
      "style": "role_direction_ambiguity",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "debt_repayment"
      ],
      "missingDimension": "creditor_vs_debtor",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-09-5-S",
      "text": "朋友垫付了我的学费，我会在约定期限内把所欠的钱还给他吗？",
      "label": "route_semantics_sufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "debt_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-09-5",
      "style": "fallback",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "debt_repayment"
      ],
      "missingDimension": null,
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
      "id": "V013-V05-RS-C-09-5-I",
      "text": "朋友和我谈过学费债务，我想占问却还没解释彼此是谁欠谁。",
      "label": "route_semantics_insufficient",
      "split": "calibration",
      "domainFamily": "debt_direction",
      "contrastGroup": "V013-V05-RS-C-09-5",
      "style": "role_direction_ambiguity",
      "routeCoverage": [
        "debt_repayment"
      ],
      "missingDimension": "creditor_vs_debtor",
      "provenance": "fresh_v05_individually_authored_modern_language_contrasts"
    },
    {
